@host=http://127.0.0.1:8080/scim/v2
@auth=Basic YWRtaW46c2VjcmV0

### List all Elements
GET {{host}}/Elements HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{auth}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### Paginated extension filter with sortBy
GET {{host}}/Elements?filter=urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:one:2.0:Element.required%20ge%200&startIndex=1&count=2&sortBy=urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:one:2.0:Element.required&sortOrder=descending HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{auth}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### Complex array filter + attribute projection on Users
GET {{host}}/Users?filter=emails%5Btype%20eq%20%22work%22%20and%20primary%20eq%20true%5D&attributes=userName,emails.value,groups HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{auth}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### POST /.search on Users (RFC 7644 3.4.3)
POST {{host}}/Users/.search HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:SearchRequest"],
  "attributes": ["userName", "groups"],
  "filter": "groups[type eq \"indirect\"]",
  "sortBy": "userName",
  "sortOrder": "ascending",
  "startIndex": 1,
  "count": 50
}

### Root POST /.search across all resource types
POST {{host}}/.search HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:SearchRequest"],
  "startIndex": 1,
  "count": 20
}
